msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (required) Search query. Can be gene symbol (e.g., "
"'CDK2'), name ('cyclin dependent kinase'), Entrez ID ('1017'), or Ensembl"
" ID ('ENSG00000123374'). Supports wildcards (\\*) and boolean operators "
"(AND, OR, NOT)."
msgstr ""

